+      "text": "Some common beliefs sound like this: \"It's too late to change.\" \"If I speak up, I'll seem ungrateful.\" \"If I don't grab the first opportunity, I'll miss my chance.\" These thoughts feel protective, but they often keep you playing smaller than your experience allows."
